          "snippet": {
            "line": 161,
            "text": "theorem fall_at_most (hD : D.Admissible) (h : IsTrajectory D u v a b)\n    (h0 : v a ∈ D.Safe) {s e ulo uhi l : ℝ} (hs : a ≤ s) (he : e ≤ b)\n    (hu : ∀ t ∈ Ico s e, ulo ≤ u t ∧ u t ≤ uhi) (hl : l ≤ v s) :\n    ∀ t ∈ Icc s e, l - (D.IdischargeMax ulo uhi + D.eps) / D.Clo * (t - s) ≤ v t := by"
